# Demo Rule — Manual (@mention to apply)

Apply this rule only when the user explicitly references it (for example: `@demo-manual-rule`).

## What to do when applied
- Write in short, audience-friendly sentences.
- Avoid Cursor-internal jargon; define terms if needed.
- Keep each mental model:
  - 1–2 sentence shortDescription
  - 4–6 bullet points in detailedExplanation
  - 3–6 relatedFeatures
  - 1–3 docs links

## What NOT to do
- Do not invent complicated workflows.
- Do not add extra files, frameworks, or backend concepts.
